# The published patched gamescope the apk build packs in (see PATCHES.md).
# It lives in The412Banner/winlator-contents beside the Linux runtime it belongs to, so Bannerlator and the SteamDeck app can share one copy.
# It is DroidDeck's build (Droid-Deck/DroidDeck release gamescope-3.16.29-p5), copied there unchanged.
# p4 added patch 0112 (a game minimized behind the Steam menu is restored on Resume) and the cheaper cursor polling in 0100;
# p5 adds 0113 (the Quick Access Menu keeps the game's keyboard focus, without the pointer warps that jolted it).
